[EN] Count of the 12 criteria (No. 1–12) of Anhang A.3 you rated N (not fulfilled) — the basis for the corrective-actions and critical-gaps fields above. Together with Y/P/NA this must sum to 12. Together with Y/P/NA the sum should equal the total (12); otherwise check REQ-17 shows a warning.' FROM worksheet_templates w JOIN standards s ON s.id = w.standard_id WHERE x.worksheet_template_id = w.id AND s.code = 'DWA-M-820-3' AND w.code = 'M8203-09' AND x.symbol = 'qe54_items_n';
