[EN] Count of the 12 criteria (No. 1–12) of Anhang A.3 you marked not applicable (NA) for this project. Per the Vorwort, the listed criteria are a cross-project selection to be chosen and supplemented project-specifically (p. 3).' FROM worksheet_templates w JOIN standards s ON s.id = w.standard_id WHERE x.worksheet_template_id = w.id AND s.code = 'DWA-M-820-3' AND w.code = 'M8203-09' AND x.symbol = 'qe54_items_na';
