[EN] Computes the percentage share of criteria rated Y among the 12 printed Anhang A.3 criteria (numerator from the register, denominator qe54_items_total). Feeds qe54_share_y_pct.' FROM worksheet_templates w JOIN standards s ON s.id = w.standard_id WHERE x.worksheet_template_id = w.id AND s.code = 'DWA-M-820-3' AND w.code = 'M8203-09' AND x.equation_number = 'M8203-09-D6';
