[EN] Total number of printed criteria in Anh. B.1 (QE 6.2: needs planning (project)): 15 (Nr. 1–15). Denominator for the shares below; it is not derived from the register automatically, you confirm it.' FROM worksheet_templates w JOIN standards s ON s.id = w.standard_id WHERE x.worksheet_template_id = w.id AND s.code = 'DWA-M-820-3' AND w.code = 'M8203-11' AND x.symbol = 'qe62_items_total';
