[EN] Automatically computed number of rows in the register above (all captured rows, whatever their rating), for comparison with the 15 printed criteria of Anh. B.1. Informational only – the completeness check above (REQ-19) still reads the manually entered count fields, not this value.' FROM worksheet_templates w JOIN standards s ON s.id = w.standard_id WHERE x.worksheet_template_id = w.id AND s.code = 'DWA-M-820-3' AND w.code = 'M8203-11' AND x.symbol = 'qe62_items_rated';
