[EN] Automatically counts how many rows in the criteria register qe62_items are rated P (partially fulfilled). Feeds only the informational field qe62_items_p_calc; the completeness check above (REQ-19) still reads the manually entered count, not this result.' FROM worksheet_templates w JOIN standards s ON s.id = w.standard_id WHERE x.worksheet_template_id = w.id AND s.code = 'DWA-M-820-3' AND w.code = 'M8203-11' AND x.equation_number = 'M8203-11-D2';
