[EN] Automatically counts how many rows in the criteria register qe62_items are rated NA (not applicable). Feeds only the informational field qe62_items_na_calc; the completeness check above (REQ-19) still reads the manually entered count, not this result.' FROM worksheet_templates w JOIN standards s ON s.id = w.standard_id WHERE x.worksheet_template_id = w.id AND s.code = 'DWA-M-820-3' AND w.code = 'M8203-11' AND x.equation_number = 'M8203-11-D4';
UPDATE equations x SET description = 'Zählt automatisch alle Zeilen im Register qe62_items (unabhängig von der Bewertung). Zum Vergleich: Anh. B.1 druckt 15 Kriterien (Nr. 1–15).
[EN] Automatically counts all rows in the register qe62_items (whatever their rating). For comparison: Anh. B.1 prints 15 criteria (Nr. 1–15).' FROM worksheet_templates w JOIN standards s ON s.id = w.standard_id WHERE x.worksheet_template_id = w.id AND s.code = 'DWA-M-820-3' AND w.code = 'M8203-11' AND x.equation_number = 'M8203-11-D5';
