[EN] Automatically computes the share of rows rated P (partially fulfilled) among the 15 printed criteria of Anh. B.1 (denominator: total QE items). Informational only, does not replace the fulfilment rate you enter.' FROM worksheet_templates w JOIN standards s ON s.id = w.standard_id WHERE x.worksheet_template_id = w.id AND s.code = 'DWA-M-820-3' AND w.code = 'M8203-11' AND x.equation_number = 'M8203-11-D7';
