[EN] Date on which you carried out this QE assessment (Anhang B.3, Teil 2: Vorbereiten + Mitwirken bei der Vergabe). Plain documentation field for traceability of when the state was captured.' FROM worksheet_templates w JOIN standards s ON s.id = w.standard_id WHERE x.worksheet_template_id = w.id AND s.code = 'DWA-M-820-3' AND w.code = 'M8203-15' AND x.symbol = 'qe64b_assessment_date';
