[EN] Share of criteria rated "NA" out of the 34 printed criteria of this annex (output of equation M8203-16-D9). A plain overview figure, not a printed fulfilment rate — the standard gives no weighting for "partially fulfilled" or treatment of "not applicable".' FROM worksheet_templates w JOIN standards s ON s.id = w.standard_id WHERE x.worksheet_template_id = w.id AND s.code = 'DWA-M-820-3' AND w.code = 'M8203-16' AND x.symbol = 'qe65_share_na_pct';
UPDATE fields x SET description = 'Ja, sobald für dieses Blatt die Projektstopp-Prüfung mit Risikoanalyse durchgeführt und dokumentiert ist, ob und wie das Projekt fortgeführt wird (§ 3 (printed p. 10, PDF p. 12)). Pflicht über REQ-12-2, sobald ein Phasenziel von § 6.5 „Nicht erreicht“ oder „Teilweise erreicht“ ist; das Ergebnis gehört zusätzlich in „Projektstopp erforderlich“ auf dem Abschlussblatt.
[EN] Yes once the Projektstopp review with risk analysis has been carried out and documented for this sheet — whether and how the project is continued (§ 3 (printed p. 10, PDF p. 12)). Required through REQ-12-2 as soon as a phase goal of § 6.5 is "Not met" or "Partially met"; the outcome also belongs in "Projektstopp required" on the closing sheet.' FROM worksheet_templates w JOIN standards s ON s.id = w.standard_id WHERE x.worksheet_template_id = w.id AND s.code = 'DWA-M-820-3' AND w.code = 'M8203-16' AND x.symbol = 'pz_65_projektstopp_risikoanalyse';
UPDATE equations x SET description = 'Zählt im Register qe65_items die Zeilen mit Bewertung „Y — erfüllt“. Speist das Feld qe65_items_y_calc, das Gegenstück zum manuellen Zählfeld qe65_items_y.
[EN] Counts the rows in register qe65_items rated "Y". Feeds field qe65_items_y_calc, the counterpart of the manual count field qe65_items_y.' FROM worksheet_templates w JOIN standards s ON s.id = w.standard_id WHERE x.worksheet_template_id = w.id AND s.code = 'DWA-M-820-3' AND w.code = 'M8203-16' AND x.equation_number = 'M8203-16-D1';
