[EN] Counts the rows in register qe65_items rated "N". Feeds field qe65_items_n_calc, the counterpart of the manual count field qe65_items_n.' FROM worksheet_templates w JOIN standards s ON s.id = w.standard_id WHERE x.worksheet_template_id = w.id AND s.code = 'DWA-M-820-3' AND w.code = 'M8203-16' AND x.equation_number = 'M8203-16-D3';
UPDATE equations x SET description = 'Zählt im Register qe65_items die Zeilen mit Bewertung „NA — nicht zutreffend“. Speist das Feld qe65_items_na_calc, das Gegenstück zum manuellen Zählfeld qe65_items_na.
[EN] Counts the rows in register qe65_items rated "NA". Feeds field qe65_items_na_calc, the counterpart of the manual count field qe65_items_na.' FROM worksheet_templates w JOIN standards s ON s.id = w.standard_id WHERE x.worksheet_template_id = w.id AND s.code = 'DWA-M-820-3' AND w.code = 'M8203-16' AND x.equation_number = 'M8203-16-D4';
UPDATE equations x SET description = 'Zählt alle Zeilen im Register qe65_items. Speist qe65_items_rated, zur Kontrolle gegen die 34 gedruckten Kriterien.
[EN] Counts all rows in register qe65_items. Feeds qe65_items_rated, to check against the 34 printed criteria.' FROM worksheet_templates w JOIN standards s ON s.id = w.standard_id WHERE x.worksheet_template_id = w.id AND s.code = 'DWA-M-820-3' AND w.code = 'M8203-16' AND x.equation_number = 'M8203-16-D5';
UPDATE equations x SET description = 'Anteil der mit „Y — erfüllt“ bewerteten Kriterien an qe65_items_total. Reine Übersichtskennzahl, kein gedruckter Erfüllungsgrad.
[EN] Share of criteria rated "Y" out of qe65_items_total. Plain overview figure, not a printed fulfilment rate.' FROM worksheet_templates w JOIN standards s ON s.id = w.standard_id WHERE x.worksheet_template_id = w.id AND s.code = 'DWA-M-820-3' AND w.code = 'M8203-16' AND x.equation_number = 'M8203-16-D6';
