[EN] Share of criteria rated "P" out of qe65_items_total. Plain overview figure, not a printed fulfilment rate.' FROM worksheet_templates w JOIN standards s ON s.id = w.standard_id WHERE x.worksheet_template_id = w.id AND s.code = 'DWA-M-820-3' AND w.code = 'M8203-16' AND x.equation_number = 'M8203-16-D7';
