[EN] Share of criteria rated "P" out of the 10 printed criteria of this annex (output of equation M8203-17-D7). A plain overview figure, not a printed fulfilment rate — the standard gives no weighting for "partially fulfilled" or treatment of "not applicable".' FROM worksheet_templates w JOIN standards s ON s.id = w.standard_id WHERE x.worksheet_template_id = w.id AND s.code = 'DWA-M-820-3' AND w.code = 'M8203-17' AND x.symbol = 'qe66_share_p_pct';
